Xbox 360: gx_api.cpp keeps the registers it reads back in g_api (as the SDK's __GXData, which display lists do not change) and reaches the GX core only through xenon/gx/xe_gx_queue.cpp, so that the core can run on a render thread; vertex descriptors and formats are written whenever set, as the SDK does. Applied by xenon/tools/xstage to the staged copy only.
diff -ru a/platform/gx/src/gx_api.cpp b/platform/gx/src/gx_api.cpp
